## Overview

A complete IoT-based environmental monitoring system that uses LoRa technology for long-range, low-power wireless communication.

The project demonstrates the complete engineering workflow including hardware design, embedded programming, wireless networking, cloud integration, and dashboard visualization.

---

## Features

✔ Long-range communication (2–15 km)

✔ Low power consumption

✔ Real-time monitoring

✔ MQTT communication

✔ Cloud dashboard

✔ Data logging

✔ Expandable sensor support

✔ Secure LoRa communication

